
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                        PolicemanCallsForYou (If you leave without talking)
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: PolicemanCallsForYou
---
<<if $firstPoliceTalkCompleted == true>>
	<<stop>>
<<endif>>

!
<<walk_to "Policeman" "Player" 2 false >>
<<wait 1>>
<<look_at "Policeman">>
<<walk_to "Policeman" "Player" 2 true >>

<<camera_return>>
<<face "Player" "Policeman">>
<<face "Policeman" "Player">>
<<wait 1>>
<<disable_controls "Player">>
Stranger: Hey! You! Stop right there!

You turn to look at a person running your way.
As he comes closer, he seems familiar

//<<camera_focus "PolicemanHead">>

You zone out thinking about it 
Policeman: Hello! I'm off duty, but you still need to respect me!
You can feel you have had one too many beers

Policeman: Hey .... Heyy you. Can you hear me? Did you hit your head?
-> Stare at him
    Policeman: Excuse me, have you been drinking tonight?
	Your look tells him everything
	Policeman: Atleast your enjoying it buddy
-> Yes, how can I help? Isn't it such a beautiful day?
	Policeman: I'm delited by your attitude, but
    Policeman: Did you not hear that a meteor is comming?

Policeman: Please Find Shelter immediately!

<<jump FirstPoliceConversation>>
===

//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                        CHAPTER 3 - TryOpenPoliceCar (Should work only once)
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: TryOpenPoliceCar
---
<<if $firstPoliceTalkCompleted == true>>
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

<<disable_controls "Player">>
You grab the handle of the police car and pull.

<<walk_to "Policeman" "Player" 1>>
<<camera_return>>
<<face "Player" "Policeman">>
<<face "Policeman" "Player">>

Policeman: What The Hell is wrong with you!
Policeman: It's the end of the world and you're stealing a police car?!
Policeman: ...you know what? I can't do this anymore.

<<camera_return>>
<<walk_to "Policeman" "PoliceCube" 1 false >>
The Policeman walks off, shaking his head, muttering something about retirement.

<<wait 2>>
You put your car key in to the ignition and try to start the car

Wierdly Nothing.
You try a couple of more times and leave the car be.

<<set $firstPoliceTalkCompleted = true>>

<<enable_controls "Player">>
===

//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                        CHAPTER 3 - POLICE FIRST CONTACT (Your Car)
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: TryOpenYourCar
---
<<if $firstPoliceTalkCompleted == true>>
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

<<disable_controls "Player">>

You pull your keys out and unlock your car.

As the door open—

<<walk_to "Policeman" "Player" -1 false>>
<<camera_return>>
<<face "Player" "Policeman">>
<<face "Policeman" "Player">>
Stranger: Sir! Stop!

You turn. A sweaty man stands there, slightly panicked.

Stranger: Do you not recognize me?

You feel that you are too drunk to do so...

Stranger: Hello? I'm the local cop, I didn't have time to put on my uniform.

You obviosly instantly recognize him..

Policeman: Did you not hear the announcment? A fucking meteor is comming!
Policeman: Please tell me you're not planning to drive right now.

Policeman: Anyways you can't get anywhere there was a big accident just around the corner
Policeman: So don't drive
-> I wasn't going to.
	Policeman: Good. Because I would have to stop you. Probably.
-> I don't care, which one is my car again?
	Policeman: That is…

Policeman: Listen. You need to find shelter. A bunker, basement, anything.

<<jump FirstPoliceConversation>>
===

//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                        CHAPTER 3 - POLICE FIRST CONTACT (Your Car)
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: TryOpenCopFriendCar
---
<<if $firstPoliceTalkCompleted == true>>
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

<<disable_controls "Player">>

You touch the door handle—

<<walk_to "Policeman" "Player" -3 false>>

You try to open the door an almost instantly you hear someone approaching

<<walk_to "Policeman" "Player" -1 false>>
<<camera_return>>
<<face "Player" "Policeman">>
<<face "Policeman" "Player">>
Stranger: HANDS UP!

You freeze.
You look back at a sweaty man smoking a cigarettes
He introduces himself as a policeman and you instantly recognize him

Policeman: You're really trying to steal my captain's car while a meteor is comming?
Policeman: Incredible. Truly. Right in front of me.

You: My bad, must be the wrong car..

Policeman: Look, I don't have time to arrest you. Just go. Find shelter.

<<jump FirstPoliceConversation>>
===

//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                        CHAPTER 3 - POLICE FIRST CONTACT
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: FirstPoliceConversation
---
<<disable_controls "Player">>
You: Where?

The policeman hesitates.

Policeman: I… don't remember exactly. Let me think...
Policeman: I remember something about safe locations but...

The Policeman is entering remembering mode

<<set $firstPoliceTalkCompleted = true>>

<<complete_and_hide "QuestTitleFindYourCar" 2>>
<<show_text "QuestTitleFindShelterStart">>
<<show_text "ObjectiveAskForDirections">>

<<look_reset>>
<<enable_controls "Player">>
===
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                        POLICE PUZZLE (Second Police Conversation)
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: SecondPoliceConversation
---
<<if $firstPoliceTalkCompleted == false>>
	<<jump PolicemanCallsForYou>>
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

<<disable_controls "Player">>
<<camera_return>>
<<face "Player" "Policeman">>
<<face "Policeman" "Player">>

<<if $gotBunkerInfo == true>>
	Policeman: What are you still doing here? Get to safety!
	<<jump PolicePuzzleResult>>
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

You (to yourself): Wait a minute, I don't think I have seen any meteors in the sky... Fake news?
You: Hey is the Government pulling my nose? I don't see no meteor
Policeman: Hahaha, I heard through radio it is going straight to Vilnius, why would they lie anyways?
You: Why would they lie? When haven't they? Those fat cats
You: But I belive you, stuff like this is always happening..

..

You (to yourself): Alright… think. How do I get him to talk?

// STAGE 1
It seems like you could pick a strategy to get more information
-> Be Kind
	<<set $copTrust += 2>>
	You: Hey, it's alright. Nothing could ruin this sunny day.
	You: You've got this.
	Policeman: Oh yeah, thanks! I'm thinking...
-> Act Sober // Change
	<<set $copTrust += 0>>
	You: I am completely fine. Proceed.
	Policeman: You sound like a robot, but okay.
-> Be Formal
	<<set $copTrust += 1>>
	Trying to act sober
	You: Officer, I Require instructions for how to get to safety now!
	Policeman: Yes, Yes. Alright, alright I'm starting to remember, keep going.

// STAGE 2
Okay Okay, maybe something different could work better?
-> Tell a Joke
    <<set $copTrust += 1>>
    You: So the joke goes
    A rabbit is walking through a forest and spots something brown on the ground
    He gives it a taste and says
    Rabbit: Eww, that's shit! Thank god I didn't step on it
    Policeman: "Oh yeah, I've heard that one, that's a good one."
-> Be Flirty
    <<set $copTrust += 0>>
    You: Hey your eyes really match your car
    Policeman: I regret approaching you.
-> Offer a Cigarette
    Policeman: Oh thanks man!
	<<complete_and_hide "ItemCigarettes" 2>>
    <<set $copTrust += 2>>

// STAGE 3
Now its basically all or nothing, you pick the right strategy or you'll die
-> Give Beer
	Policeman: That is so nice of you. :)
	<<complete_and_hide "ItemBeer2" 1>>
	<<show_text "ItemBeer1">>
	<<set $copTrust += 2>>
-> Become Emotional
	You: Please my dear friend, I want to live
	You: Can't you understand
	Policeman: ...yeah, same. That doesn't really help, does it?
	<<set $copTrust += 0>>
-> Blame The Government
	You: Saeima probably knew and still did nothing.
	Policeman: If I speak, I get fired. So I will not speak.
	<<set $copTrust += 1>>

// RESULT
<<jump PolicePuzzleResult>>
===

//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                        Police Puzzle Result
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: PolicePuzzleResult
---
<<complete_and_hide "QuestTitleFindShelterStart" 1>>
<<complete_and_hide "ObjectiveAskForDirections" 1>>

<<if $copTrust < 1>>
	Policeman: Now that I've been thinking about it, I've decided to never tell you where to go
    Policeman: You have treated me badly and broken my trust
    Policeman: Please Leave...
	<<show_text "QuestTitleFindBunker">>
	<<show_text "ObjectiveFindBunkerOnYourOwn">>
<<elseif $copTrust < 3>>
	Policeman: So thinking about hasn't brought up a lot of memories for me
	Policeman: I guess the Church maybe? 
	Policeman: There are also some houses around here marked as a shelter
	Policeman: Anyways, anything else? I have stopped enjoying looking at your face..
	<<show_text "QuestTitleFindBunker">>
	<<show_text "ObjectiveFindBunkerBad1">>
	<<show_text "ObjectiveFindBunkerBad2">>
<<elseif $copTrust < 5>>
	Policeman: So to best of my knowledge
	He is sweating balls
	Policeman: I know that there where three on Liepajas street and another on Dumpu street.
	Policeman: I would start with Liepajas 5, or was it 15? Or even 10?
	Policeman: Be sure to remember this!
	Policeman: Anything else?
	<<show_text "QuestTitleFindBunker">>
	<<show_text "ObjectiveFindBunkerOkay1">>
	<<show_text "ObjectiveFindBunkerOkay2">>
	<<show_text "ObjectiveFindBunkerOkay3">>
	<<show_text "ObjectiveFindBunkerOkay4">>
<<else>>
	Policeman: So based on my photographic memory that thanks to your speeking skills I was able to reactivate
	Policeman: The following addresses have available shelter
	Policeman: Dumpu iela 4, Liepajas iela 10, 13 and 15
	Policeman: Be sure to remember this buddy!
	Policeman: Anything else?
	<<set $gotBunkerInfo = true>>
	<<show_text "QuestTitleFindBunker">>
	<<show_text "ObjectiveFindBunkerGood1">>
	<<show_text "ObjectiveFindBunkerGood2">>
	<<show_text "ObjectiveFindBunkerGood3">>
	<<show_text "ObjectiveFindBunkerGood4">>
<<endif>>

You: Alright Thank you! Will you be coming with?
Policeman: No.. there might be other drunks looking for help, meet you there!
Policeman: I'm like the drunk Superman!
You: Okay, I guess good luck! Stay safe and goodbye!
<<walk_to "Policeman" "PoliceCube" 1 false >>

You (under your breath): More like the pigman
You immediately feel bad about saying that

<<camera_return>>
<<enable_controls "Player">>
===

